<bblocks://ogc.heritage.observation> a skos:Concept,
        dcat:Dataset,
        bblocks:BBlock,
        bblocks:Schema ;
    rdfs:label "Observation" ;
    dct:abstract "A scientific observation or measurement of a heritage object or place — environmental monitoring, condition assessment, conservation science — profiling the SOSA/SSN Observation. `hasFeatureOfInterest` ties the reading back to the heritage object or place being measured (CIDOC-CRM/CRMsci's scientific observation context); `madeBySensor` is expected to reference an OGC SensorThings API `Sensor`."^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
